lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JanKim27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","html_url":"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/commit/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c"}]},{"sha":"f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","node_id":"C_kwDOCBF7SNoAKGY2N2UyNDQwNmM0YjdiMGRiZThmZTc2Y2I1YjZkNTYxMmFiNTNmMGM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jay Herpin","email":"159202566+JayHerpin@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-04T20:37:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-04T20:37:32Z"},"message":"fix(theta_star_planner): charge unknown cells consistently at both cost sites (#6433)\n\nThe line-of-sight isSafe() overload replaced the scaled cost of an unknown cell\nwith OCCUPIED_COST - 1 before squaring it, while getTraversalCost() passed the\nscaled UNKNOWN_COST straight through. The same unknown cell therefore cost\n2*(255.5/252)^2 via an expansion step and 2*(253/252)^2 via a line-of-sight\ncheck, so which charge applied depended only on the code path that reached it.\nNeither figure is on the same scale as the other: the substituted value was a\nraw costmap cost used where getCost()'s scaled output was expected.\n\nClamp in getCost() instead, which both sites read through, and drop the\nredundant substitution in isSafe(). An unknown cell is now charged as\n26 + 0.9*(OCCUPIED_COST - 1) at both sites. Unknown cells are still admitted\nonly via the existing allow_unknown clause, that value still exceeding\nMAX_NON_OBSTACLE_COST, so they are blocked as before when allow_unknown is\nfalse.\n\ngetCost() also had its doc block opened with /* rather than /**, so doxygen\ndropped its @brief; corrected while documenting the clamp here.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ffce53e7523d887bd0da76da73ddc6c9331c8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/git/trees/6ffce53e7523d887bd0da76da73ddc6c9331c8ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/git/commits/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmywMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyPIQAJbarJcdrde8GtWZgtCyaSj5\nCq9hAg1ig0PHyArXJ59guQF/ylK8zLZYVbIEgqm/ipAeAWaKKT3x5Y9yUtQt5vDj\n3rbOnuP4+yQ6o6gPtfDsxIWE1TBwSsAT9pGp9BYoq8cspN7JwvwaDIshrXWnR3nV\n9actMbtKWRDP4fGxxMVwjQXY3416D6ZWDh7QvjEPIdx8X2n9GQIfdQOYjpStp5CO\nJBZRlv6zNGRkXvigQCguPsMjSe4hfeGTTdObakTzqybKN0LIKSOYudIGICdmzMtP\n6G55ULYTf7E/mLekEMcYK5m17OeSaLAScrbHGsTGlVcoOKnsW6+H7U6rUdo9Frfm\nS+epct3kyQTEhvmMeOhFY9eNiNlsmohdsU3/C9YL1QIbVuhFsj1hQhVi9Y9XNQb5\nI/UYFuxQpwMdlGNmiJSkIBtgiSHac56L4dbYxBiNFM+tr6n+A46v5VlMXBE1wN4p\nODlIi8xAikPI9WHgQ7DNQWCJzlYNLeT6qUwzOfbEEr7eh5uEQ3hIbwo9Wk3sUWvI\nG8A3oyKfqlPkvi3+nTUqKqIIG6yCoeiDR6Y8oGx2INVu7yJ4ncCZ64Uo/gmYSYJG\nkxrs92BA26fIjNiwoJ/HKYTMVoUrsQrYC4C0xq9ohm4PacOqFE7Fk0CssRetWiWZ\nwsz2a7FQDZN+4ahAUtMU\n=PH8U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6ffce53e7523d887bd0da76da73ddc6c9331c8ea\nparent 43dd8c562184ecbfe30f701c03f3593fea627095\nauthor Jay Herpin <159202566+JayHerpin@users.noreply.github.com> 1788554252 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788554252 -0700\n\nfix(theta_star_planner): charge unknown cells consistently at both cost sites (#6433)\n\nThe line-of-sight isSafe() overload replaced the scaled cost of an unknown cell\nwith OCCUPIED_COST - 1 before squaring it, while getTraversalCost() passed the\nscaled UNKNOWN_COST straight through. The same unknown cell therefore cost\n2*(255.5/252)^2 via an expansion step and 2*(253/252)^2 via a line-of-sight\ncheck, so which charge applied depended only on the code path that reached it.\nNeither figure is on the same scale as the other: the substituted value was a\nraw costmap cost used where getCost()'s scaled output was expected.\n\nClamp in getCost() instead, which both sites read through, and drop the\nredundant substitution in isSafe(). An unknown cell is now charged as\n26 + 0.9*(OCCUPIED_COST - 1) at both sites. Unknown cells are still admitted\nonly via the existing allow_unknown clause, that value still exceeding\nMAX_NON_OBSTACLE_COST, so they are blocked as before when allow_unknown is\nfalse.\n\ngetCost() also had its doc block opened with /* rather than /**, so doxygen\ndropped its @brief; corrected while documenting the clamp here.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-04T20:37:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","html_url":"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/commit/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/f67e24406c4b7b0dbe8fe76cb5b6d5612ab53f0c/comments","author":{"login":"JayHerpin","id":159202566,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX09Bg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159202566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin","html_url":"https://github.com/JayHerpin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/star