sers/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","html_url":"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/commit/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf"}]},{"sha":"4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","node_id":"C_kwDOCBF7SNoAKDQ0MjRkODI3Y2FmM2QxNjdhYWYzNGE3ZDJmYmNkOTYyOWIxOGE4YmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jay Herpin","email":"159202566+JayHerpin@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-03T16:59:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-03T16:59:15Z"},"message":"fix(theta_star_planner): validate w_euc_cost and keep w_heuristic_cost in sync (#6425)\n\nvalidateParameterUpdatesCallback() rejects non-positive weights but the load\npath did not, so a planner could start from YAML in a state the same node would\nrefuse at runtime. w_euc_cost scales the euclidean term and w_heuristic_cost is\nderived from it, so at zero both vanish and the search is left ranking paths on\nthe traversal term alone. A negative w_traversal_cost yields negative edge\nweights on the same footing.\n\nupdateParametersCallback() also assigned w_euc_cost without recomputing\nw_heuristic_cost, which is min(w_euc_cost, 1.0). Lowering w_euc_cost at runtime\nleft the heuristic too large, where it can exceed the true remaining cost.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>","tree":{"sha":"88e1768bdd699b941bddccc4519a1373fcf2237b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/git/trees/88e1768bdd699b941bddccc4519a1373fcf2237b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/git/commits/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmadjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACOYQALDUolOORpOEBKi8R3SLSxgg\nfrDJJlMAvX9OdKbsOwDwPvroD7qKkbJytASCcFNbsScqKwWOtoksOjX89/VDnrhS\nN3v3ZoejQoYixoMGRLgE9uTLYWCcmNoBvvQjKLceRtyYlp6Ee0X3ZcOhffbBoEkm\nhpYzf6di+JkDgMNU7AhvS+irEUOxPvXy9o3W8BeAk+s6MgrV5z7R917Eyt/7qCpy\nD4CoHFJDMGPCBW309dy8lFRpay9snMdPqE3dSeaUZkT+uDaK2Awa7xAmgFDq+0KZ\n2lyssBdJPdOmvxqtRgAZuwD2ENN6BQ3k4no/QBJQqzgF50OE9jXDGkII2OftoEN8\nMnNnxIIWNn5qQcYhefuLd4faWhveMlChBsanh9JGG1e2sR9Ce7ujd++NLMx/cLaS\naFF4LakqOYW97OcCBlcubqnHyqg3i4dfHiiccXeoLDi+6JGZj8WVD/iWfxo2izcL\nNZwE7dRG44qixcV2Tuo2Iv1qAUPhb5W2Fs5WrzAw4ucBBkVC8jPRLcEUM+Kw10rv\nnIYiy3nFV+2CgZYzq67/0TXcXt3fWSzSuL6mjd90/yH+2aB4/rlKn9Z8bxsxm49i\nbJ2Loy8enK1Xqw+Sg4XA6+4nAjm1Z1wMHHCovdIwgd7dTsDcSMpVHkl1gb1kzEbG\nnKYImUbaS4kISVzxPFy3\n=214z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 88e1768bdd699b941bddccc4519a1373fcf2237b\nparent 9b873008d1ff1facf7521814a47700d078715ca3\nauthor Jay Herpin <159202566+JayHerpin@users.noreply.github.com> 1788454755 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788454755 -0700\n\nfix(theta_star_planner): validate w_euc_cost and keep w_heuristic_cost in sync (#6425)\n\nvalidateParameterUpdatesCallback() rejects non-positive weights but the load\npath did not, so a planner could start from YAML in a state the same node would\nrefuse at runtime. w_euc_cost scales the euclidean term and w_heuristic_cost is\nderived from it, so at zero both vanish and the search is left ranking paths on\nthe traversal term alone. A negative w_traversal_cost yields negative edge\nweights on the same footing.\n\nupdateParametersCallback() also assigned w_euc_cost without recomputing\nw_heuristic_cost, which is min(w_euc_cost, 1.0). Lowering w_euc_cost at runtime\nleft the heuristic too large, where it can exceed the true remaining cost.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jay Herpin <jherpin@metalsharkboats.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-03T16:59:15Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","html_url":"https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/commit/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ros-navigation/navigation2/commits/4424d827caf3d167aaf34a7d2fbcd9629b18a8bf/comments","author":{"login":"JayHerpin","id":159202566,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX09Bg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159202566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin","html_url":"https://github.com/JayHerpin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JayHerpin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url"